flowchart TB
    Laptop[Authorised lab laptop] -->|NetBird and SSH key| SSH[Private management]
    SSH -->|Local forward| Caddy[Loopback HTTPS / Caddy]
    Caddy --> Vault[Vaultwarden]
    Caddy --> Cloud[Nextcloud]
    Caddy --> Kuma[Private Uptime Kuma]
    Cloud --> DB[PostgreSQL / internal network]
    Cloud --> Redis[Redis / internal network]
    Core[Core service data] --> Backup[Encrypted off-source backup]
    Backup --> Restore[Isolated restore and access tests]
